  "content": "\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/ef905b4dc7b682b20b580d7b34e10f8d018294c9.png\" alt=\"An room interior with large windows, a fireplace, a dog sleeping and a cat stretching\">\n<h3>Forager 附加包是額外的資源包，為 <a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/forager-6745054/\">Forager！</a> 增添額外功能。</h3>\n<br>這些資源包可以獨立使用，但設計初衷是與 Forager 搭配運行。<br>請務必將任何擴充套件置於基礎資源包之上，才能正常運作！\n<h4>適用於版本 1.19 - 1.21.10</h4>\n\n<h2>附加包</h2>\n\n<details>\n<summary>2D 替代方案</summary>\n將 Forager 的自訂方塊替換為 2D 版本。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/8ef11e780ad685010c96cfb7a65771f5d791dfa3.png\" alt=\"Comparison between two screenshots\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Extra Mobs</summary>\n此資源包為生物增添了更多細節，包括更豐富的牛、山羊和綿羊角，蓬鬆的爬行者，以及天使般的惡靈。亦可搭配 Fresh Animations 版本使用。需要 ETF/EMF 或 OptiFine 才能運作。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/7d697ec62b99e960c7794fac0332bdf1e5895a46.png\" alt=\"Three images of mobs\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Fresh Animations (FA)</summary>\n與 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fresh-animations\">Fresh Animations</a> 相容的資源包。需要 ETF/EMF 或 OptiFine 才能運作。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/ff68d94992e681436807cef979a14fb49fc12d0d.png\" alt=\"A cat stretching\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>連接紋理</summary>\n為各種方塊（如草地、石頭等）添加連接紋理。需要 Continuity 或 OptiFine 才能運作。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/6fd569374e72c3ccb05a544b447eeef527a51b75.png\" alt=\"Outside image of path blocks\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>透明玻璃連接紋理</summary>\n此資源包添加了透明玻璃的連接紋理。需要 Continuity 或 OptiFine 才能運作。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/2de6edc55738a5088689832755978868dc93edcc.png\" alt=\"Room interior with big windows\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>精緻花窗玻璃</summary>\n將玻璃更換為復古風格的紋理。亦可搭配連接紋理版本使用，該版本需要 Continuity 或 OptiFine 才能運作。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/401366cfd5bea0bf289f885c433dad4ce4622900.png\" alt=\"Room interior with windows\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>簡約護甲</summary>\n讓護甲外觀更加低調不搶眼。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/ff401292ad0caf0a9a5bdfb7230fa9137c836e94.png\" alt=\"A armor stand and player wearing armor\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>發光礦石</summary>\n為礦石添加自發光紋理。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/2eb34b5f5803c39e37b8e7a4bc73aef8f4ef2de7.png\" alt=\"A cave with glowing ores\">\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>茂密樹葉</summary>\n重新設計樹葉方塊，使其看起來更加豐滿。\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/xwyQJpNX/images/e645d544e64a99e2882febcad13a8df64550b270.png\" alt=\"A building with trees\">\n</details>\n\n<h4>使用條款</h4>\n\n歡迎您：\n- 安裝至伺服器\n- 修改內容供個人使用\n- 分享時註明出處\n<p>請勿：</p>\n\n- 重新上傳或販售\n- 修改、複製設計並聲稱擁有所有權\n- 未註明出處地分享\n\n<br>如有任何疑問，請私訊詢問授權\n<hr>\n</p>\n<h4>若想獲取最新更新或優先體驗新版本，歡迎支援我的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/caninegray\">Patreon</a> 或 <a href=\"https://https://ko-fi.com/caninegray\">Ko-fi！</a></h4>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/CTGMIPQp/images/7704cc56ff6d3e67a0fc22c68109cbabb48f2ebc.png\" alt=\"Grid of minecraft block textures\">",
